        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>First Impressions SCR01, Sacramento Door Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nLooking as if it came straight off a castle gate, the Twisted Sacramento Door Handle is a stunning piece of artistry that is sure to bring a little bit of the old world to your home or business. This twisted square door pull is available in 12 inch, 24 inch, and 36 inch lengths. Choose from thru-bolt mounting, surface mounting, and back-to-back mounting.  \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"text\">\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the First Impressions SCR01 Sacramento Door Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/kaba-simplex-902-size.gif?v=1704354717\" width=\"100\" height=\"72\" border=\"0\" align=\"right\" alt=\"made in the USA\">\r\n<li>Material: Aluminum</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/FII-SCR01-specifications.pdf?v=1704262336\"><b>First Impressions SCR01 Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 4 Sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>FII-SCR01012:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 12\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 11-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 2-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<b>FII-SCR01018:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 18\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 17-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 2-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>FII-SCR01024:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 24\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 23-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 2-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>FII-SCR01036:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 36\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 35-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 2-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Mounting Hardware:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Thru-Bolted Mounting:</b> Pull bolts through the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Surface Mounting:</b> Pull screws to the face of the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Back-to-Back Mounting:</b> Pulls bolt to each other through the door. <b>Requires 2 pulls</b>.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold individually (1 door pull handle). If you order Back-to-Back Mounting please Order 2 Pulls.</i>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Twisted Sacramento Door Handle",
                "description": "Looking as if it came straight off a castle gate, the Twisted Sacramento Door Handle is a stunning piece of artistry that is sure to bring a little bit of the old world to your home or business. This twisted square door pull is available in 12 inch, 24 inch, and 36 inch lengths. Choose from thru-bolt mounting, surface mounting, and back-to-back mounting.",
